&lt;p&gt;If you're preparing for a frontend interview, which area do you find most challenging?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JavaScript coding questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React concepts and hooks&lt;/li&gt;
