&lt;p&gt;The Wingo UI size needs a footnote: in most apps it is the heaviest of the four, because it animates with motion. In a shadcn-style project that already ships tailwind-merge, lucide-react and Radix, it adds 57.6 kB, motion included. If that app already uses motion too, it adds only its own 12.2 kB, and with nothing shared it is 69 kB, seven times Sonner. Its styles are Tailwind classes that compile into your app's stylesheet, so they are not in these numbers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Sonner vs react hot toast: which one should you use?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use Sonner if you want a stack, swipe and action buttons without writing them. Use react-hot-toast if you want the smallest package and plan to render toasts your own way. The two look alike at the call site until you need a button:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// sonner: action and cancel are options&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;sonner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;onDelete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Listing deleted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;City bike, Trek FX 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;label&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Undo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// react-hot-toast: no action option, so the button is your markup&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;react-hot-toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;onDelete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;span&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
Listing deleted
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;dismiss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
Undo
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;span&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;));&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Beyond buttons, react-hot-toast lists toasts instead of stacking them, has no swipe and no keyboard handling, and pauses its timers only on mouse enter and leave, not for keyboard focus or a background tab. Success toasts default to 2 seconds, which is short for an Undo. Its strength is the headless entry: &lt;code&gt;useToaster&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;react-hot-toast/headless&lt;/code&gt; hands you the toasts plus &lt;code&gt;startPause&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;endPause&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;calculateOffset&lt;/code&gt;, the right shape if you want full control of the markup and will write the gestures yourself.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Sonner gives you polished defaults: a 356px stack, swipe in the directions its position allows, &lt;code&gt;toast.promise&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;richColors&lt;/code&gt; and a close button, with timers that pause while you hover, while you swipe and while the tab is in the background. Its look comes from its own stylesheet, so matching a design system means CSS variables and &lt;code&gt;classNames&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;unstyled&lt;/code&gt; and your own markup.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


When is React-Toastify the better pick?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pick React-Toastify when you need features the others leave out: a progress bar on every toast, on by default, and a controlled &lt;code&gt;progress&lt;/code&gt; value for uploads. &lt;code&gt;limit&lt;/code&gt; holds extra toasts in a waiting queue, &lt;code&gt;toast.update(id, options)&lt;/code&gt; changes a toast in place, &lt;code&gt;stacked&lt;/code&gt; collapses the list, and the &lt;code&gt;useNotificationCenter&lt;/code&gt; add-on keeps a history of toasts for an inbox. It handles RTL and positions its container with &lt;code&gt;env(safe-area-inset-*)&lt;/code&gt; on phones.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Its defaults are the loudest of the four: a close button and a progress bar on every toast, 5 seconds on screen, and &lt;code&gt;role="alert"&lt;/code&gt; on each toast, so screen readers interrupt the user for a "Saved" message unless you pass &lt;code&gt;role="status"&lt;/code&gt;. We found no &lt;code&gt;prefers-reduced-motion&lt;/code&gt; rule in the 11.1.0 package, so the default Bounce transition plays for everyone; pass &lt;code&gt;transition={Slide}&lt;/code&gt; or your own &lt;code&gt;cssTransition&lt;/code&gt; if that matters to you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If those defaults or the styling are why you want a React Toastify alternative, Sonner is the closest swap for the call sites (&lt;code&gt;toast.success&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.error&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.promise&lt;/code&gt;). The main rename is the promise's loading message: React-Toastify calls it &lt;code&gt;pending&lt;/code&gt; and Sonner calls it &lt;code&gt;loading&lt;/code&gt;. A history with read state is an inbox, a different job: Wingo UI keeps it in a separate &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/notification-center" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Notification Center&lt;/a&gt; with a bell and an unread count.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What does "shadcn toast" mean in 2026?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It depends on the project's base. Since July 2026 new shadcn/ui projects start on Base UI, and for those &lt;code&gt;npx shadcn@latest add toast&lt;/code&gt; installs a Toast &lt;a href="https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/changelog/2026-07-toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;built on Base UI primitives&lt;/a&gt;, called with &lt;code&gt;toast.add({ title, description })&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;toast.promise&lt;/code&gt;. In Radix and React Aria projects, the old Toast is marked deprecated and the docs point to &lt;a href="https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/radix/sonner" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sonner&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;npx shadcn@latest add sonner&lt;/code&gt; writes a &lt;code&gt;components/ui/sonner.tsx&lt;/code&gt; that wraps the package, maps its colors to your &lt;code&gt;--popover&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;--border&lt;/code&gt; tokens and reads the theme from &lt;code&gt;next-themes&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So the shadcn toast in a Radix project is Sonner with your colors: you own a short wrapper, and the stack, timers and swipe stay in &lt;code&gt;node_modules/sonner&lt;/code&gt;. The Base UI version hands you more of the markup, with behavior from Base UI's &lt;code&gt;Toast&lt;/code&gt; parts. Per the &lt;a href="https://base-ui.com/react/components/toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Base UI docs&lt;/a&gt;, that means a 5 second default timeout, a limit of 3, swipe down or right, a &lt;code&gt;priority: "high"&lt;/code&gt; option for urgent announcements, and F6 to move focus into the toast region.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What changes on a phone?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The phone is where these libraries differ most, on four points:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Width.&lt;/strong&gt; Sonner spans the screen below 600px with 16px gutters (&lt;code&gt;mobileOffset&lt;/code&gt;). React-Toastify spans it below 480px with square corners. react-hot-toast has no phone layout: its toasts cap at 350px and sit 16px from the edges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Buttons.&lt;/strong&gt; Sonner's default action and cancel buttons are 24px tall, exactly WCAG 2.2's minimum target size, and its close button is 20px, under it. All of them are far from the 44pt Apple recommends for iOS controls; our &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/blog/minimum-touch-target-size-react-tailwind" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;guide to minimum touch target size&lt;/a&gt; has the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Safe areas.&lt;/strong&gt; React-Toastify positions its container with the safe area insets. Sonner and react-hot-toast do not, so with &lt;code&gt;viewport-fit=cover&lt;/code&gt; a bottom stack can sit on the iPhone home indicator until you add the inset to the offset yourself. &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/blog/tailwind-safe-area-insets" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Tailwind safe area insets&lt;/a&gt; shows the pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Swipe.&lt;/strong&gt; Sonner dismisses after 45px of travel or a quick flick. React-Toastify swipes on touch only by default and wants 80% of the toast's width. react-hot-toast has no swipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We built the Wingo UI Toast around that list. Below 768px toasts span the width with 16px gutters, each edge uses &lt;code&gt;max(env(safe-area-inset-*), 16px)&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;mobilePosition="top"&lt;/code&gt; moves them clear of a bottom tab bar. Action and close buttons look 32px tall and keep a 44px hit area on touch screens. With no hover on a phone, a tap fans out the stack.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live demo: Toast.&lt;/strong&gt; The original article embeds an interactive demo here (Hover the stack to fan it out (tap it on a phone), then swipe the front toast toward the edge. Press Failed payment, then Retry: the same toast turns into a loading state and then a success). &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/blog/sonner-alternative-react-toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Try it live on wingo-ui.com&lt;/a&gt; or open the &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Toast docs&lt;/a&gt;. Install: &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add toast&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


How do the toasts sound to a screen reader?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All four announce through ARIA live regions; the difference is what gets interrupted. A polite announcement waits until the screen reader finishes speaking. An assertive one, which &lt;code&gt;role="alert"&lt;/code&gt; implies, cuts in.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Sonner&lt;/strong&gt; wraps every toast in one &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;section aria-live="polite"&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; labeled "Notifications alt+T". A failed payment is announced as politely as "Copied".&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;react-hot-toast&lt;/strong&gt; gives each toast &lt;code&gt;role="status"&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;aria-live="polite"&lt;/code&gt;, and you can switch a single toast to &lt;code&gt;alert&lt;/code&gt; through its &lt;code&gt;ariaProps&lt;/code&gt; option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;React-Toastify&lt;/strong&gt; gives each toast &lt;code&gt;role="alert"&lt;/code&gt;, so every toast interrupts unless you change the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Wingo UI&lt;/strong&gt; makes each toast its own polite &lt;code&gt;status&lt;/code&gt; and switches errors, and any toast sent with &lt;code&gt;important: true&lt;/code&gt;, to &lt;code&gt;role="alert"&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For the keyboard, Sonner's Alt+T focuses the list and Escape collapses it, React-Toastify's focuses a toast and pauses every timer until Escape, and react-hot-toast has none. In the Wingo UI Toast, Alt+T (Option+T on a Mac) focuses the newest toast, Tab walks through its buttons, Escape dismisses the focused toast, and timers pause while keyboard focus is inside, so there is time to reach Undo.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


When should you skip the toast and use an inline alert?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Skip it when the message has to be read or acted on. A declined card, a form that failed to save, or a session about to expire need a message that stays next to the problem. Toasts time out, sit far from the field that caused them, and on a phone they can cover the submit button. Use an inline alert for those and keep toasts for confirmations, progress and quick undos. The free &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/alert" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Alert&lt;/a&gt; follows the same split for screen readers: danger and warning tones use &lt;code&gt;role="alert"&lt;/code&gt;, the others &lt;code&gt;role="status"&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live demo: Alert.&lt;/strong&gt; The original article embeds an interactive demo here (A declined card belongs next to the Pay button: press Try again and the alert collapses, then press Pay to see it expand back in). &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/blog/sonner-alternative-react-toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Try it live on wingo-ui.com&lt;/a&gt; or open the &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/alert" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Alert docs&lt;/a&gt;. Install: &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add alert&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What does a source-owned toast give you?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A source-owned toast puts the whole component in your repository: the store, the stack, the gesture and the markup. You review it like the rest of your code, and nothing changes under you on &lt;code&gt;npm update&lt;/code&gt;. The cost is that upstream fixes reach you only when you pull them. The Wingo UI Toast is free; install it with the CLI:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add toast
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;That writes &lt;code&gt;components/ui/toast.tsx&lt;/code&gt; plus the button, the spinner and the hooks and helpers it uses. Mount the Toaster once, next to the app:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/providers.tsx&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ReactNode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Toaster&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/components/ui/toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;Providers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ReactNode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Toaster&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;richColors&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;mobilePosition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"top"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Then call &lt;code&gt;toast&lt;/code&gt; from anywhere, even outside React or before the Toaster mounts:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;@/components/ui/toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;onDelete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Listing deleted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;City bike, Trek FX 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;label&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Undo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;restore&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;publishListing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;publish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;price&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// returns the original promise: await gives you the data or throws the error&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;toast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;publish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;loading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Publishing the listing…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;`Published for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;price&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Could not publish the listing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Beyond those call sites, the file gives you:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Updates by id.&lt;/strong&gt; Calling &lt;code&gt;toast.loading("Uploading 3 photos… 2/3", { id: "upload" })&lt;/code&gt; again updates the toast in place. A new type with the same id, such as &lt;code&gt;toast.success&lt;/code&gt;, starts it over, so the loading toast's &lt;code&gt;Infinity&lt;/code&gt; duration never sticks to the success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Your tokens.&lt;/strong&gt; The surface uses &lt;code&gt;bg-popover&lt;/code&gt; and your theme's status tones, so dark mode needs no &lt;code&gt;theme&lt;/code&gt; prop. Visual props such as &lt;code&gt;radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;width&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;richColors&lt;/code&gt; can also be set app-wide through &lt;code&gt;UIProvider&lt;/code&gt; defaults.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Updates that keep your edits.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest update&lt;/code&gt; merges a new release into the file you changed, as &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/docs/updates" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;the updates docs&lt;/a&gt; describe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The trade-offs, stated plainly. It is younger than the three packages, and Sonner has years of bug reports behind it. It costs more bytes than any of them, even in an app that already uses motion. In a shadcn project created with a Base UI style, install it with the Wingo UI CLI instead of &lt;code&gt;shadcn add&lt;/code&gt;, because that style rewrites &lt;code&gt;asChild&lt;/code&gt;, which the button relies on. The Notification Center is part of &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/pricing" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Wingo UI Pro&lt;/a&gt;; the Toast and the Alert are free.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


How do you move from Sonner to the Wingo UI Toast?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most call sites only change the import. The API follows Sonner's: &lt;code&gt;toast&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.success&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;error&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;warning&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;info&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;loading&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.promise&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.custom&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.dismiss&lt;/code&gt;, the &lt;code&gt;action&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;cancel&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;toasterId&lt;/code&gt; options, and the &lt;code&gt;position&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;expand&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;visibleToasts&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;duration&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;richColors&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;closeButton&lt;/code&gt; props keep their names and defaults. The differences:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="table-wrapper-paragraph"&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Sonner&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Wingo UI Toast&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;import { toast } from "sonner"&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;import { toast } from "@/components/ui/toast"&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;hotkey={["altKey", "KeyT"]}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;hotkey="alt+t"&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;Toaster id="editor" /&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; for a second toaster&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;Toaster toasterId="editor" /&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;toast.promise(...).unwrap()&lt;/code&gt; for the result&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;toast.promise(...)&lt;/code&gt; returns the original promise&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;theme&lt;/code&gt; prop, or &lt;code&gt;next-themes&lt;/code&gt; in the shadcn wrapper&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;None; the surface uses your tokens&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;event.preventDefault()&lt;/code&gt; in an action keeps the toast open&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The same, or &lt;code&gt;keepOpen: true&lt;/code&gt; on the action&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;mobileOffset&lt;/code&gt; below 600px&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;mobileOffset&lt;/code&gt; below 768px, plus &lt;code&gt;mobilePosition&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;code&gt;toast.message&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;toast.getHistory&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Not available; &lt;code&gt;useToasts()&lt;/code&gt; returns the toasts on screen&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you used the shadcn wrapper, delete &lt;code&gt;components/ui/sonner.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, point the &lt;code&gt;Toaster&lt;/code&gt; import at &lt;code&gt;@/components/ui/toast&lt;/code&gt;, and replace &lt;code&gt;from "sonner"&lt;/code&gt; in the files that call &lt;code&gt;toast&lt;/code&gt;. Then drop any &lt;code&gt;theme&lt;/code&gt; prop from the Toaster and the &lt;code&gt;.unwrap()&lt;/code&gt; after promise toasts, which TypeScript flags.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Where should you start?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If Sonner works and nobody has complained, keep it. If the complaint is about phones, screen readers or a design system that will not bend, try a source-owned toast: run &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add toast&lt;/code&gt;, which is free and needs no account, swap the import on a few call sites, and open the app on your own phone.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Components in this post
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Toast&lt;/a&gt; (Free): Toast notifications: a Toaster mounted once and a toast() you call from anywhere, stacked, swipeable and paused while you read. Install: &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add toast&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/alert" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Alert&lt;/a&gt; (Free): An inline message about a page or a section, from a failed payment to a maintenance banner, in three variants and six tones. Install: &lt;code&gt;npx wingo-ui@latest add alert&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


FAQ
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


What is the best Sonner alternative for React?
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It depends on why you are leaving. react-hot-toast is the smallest and has a headless hook, React-Toastify has the most built-in features, and a source-owned toast like the free Wingo UI Toast keeps a Sonner-style API while every behavior lives in a file you can edit.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Is Sonner better than react-hot-toast?
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Sonner does more out of the box: a collapsed stack, swipe to dismiss, action and cancel buttons, a promise toast and an Alt+T shortcut. react-hot-toast is about half the size at 4.8 kB gzip in our build and ships a headless useToaster hook, but it has no swipe, no keyboard shortcut and no built-in action buttons.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Does shadcn/ui still use Sonner for toasts?
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It depends on the project's base. In Radix and React Aria projects the old Toast is deprecated and npx shadcn@latest add sonner installs a short wrapper around the sonner package. In Base UI projects, the default for new projects since July 2026, npx shadcn@latest add toast installs a Toast built on Base UI with a toast.add() API.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Which React toast library is the smallest?
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;react-hot-toast, at 4.8 kB minified and gzipped in our esbuild measurement in October 2026. Sonner came to 9.6 kB and React-Toastify to 9.8 kB, both including the CSS they inject from JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Are toast notifications accessible to screen readers?
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;They are announced through ARIA live regions, but the libraries differ in urgency: Sonner announces everything politely, React-Toastify marks every toast role="alert" by default, and react-hot-toast and the Wingo UI Toast let single toasts interrupt. Anything the user must act on belongs in an inline alert, because toasts time out.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This article was originally published on the Wingo UI blog: &lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/blog/sonner-alternative-react-toast" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sonner Alternative for React: 4 Toast Libraries Compared&lt;/a&gt;. The original has the live, interactive demos and is kept up to date.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;An agent can change a heading and pass the type checker while leaving it cramped on mobile. I built Arguseye so the agent can inspect the rendered component before calling the edit done.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disclosure: This article was written with AI assistance using Arguseye’s source, product documentation, and recorded component captures. I’m the maker of Arguseye.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Arguseye brings that inspection into the editing loop. It renders an existing React, browser-renderable Next.js, or Vue 3 component using the project’s own source and installed packages. You can use it through MCP, the CLI, or a VS Code preview panel without starting the application or authoring a story.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is the workflow for one edit, including what to do when application context is missing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What a coding agent needs to see
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A screenshot helps with spacing, clipping, and typography. An agent also needs to know which inputs produced it and whether the render is trustworthy enough to compare.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Arguseye returns a cropped PNG and accessibility text together with the target, viewport, resolved props, unresolved inputs, source fingerprint, timings, warnings, and &lt;code&gt;errors: string[]&lt;/code&gt;. A render can succeed while remaining incomplete. For example, the component may depend on a runtime value or provider that the isolated preview cannot reconstruct.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That distinction should affect the agent’s next action. It might supply an explicit prop, choose another usage, or explain why the full application still needs checking.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fwumnn66xakn48ey67cm2.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fwumnn66xakn48ey67cm2.png" alt="Existing CSCA.ai HeroSection source and its rendered component in the real VS Code extension" width="800" height="500"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The screenshot shows CSCA.ai’s existing &lt;code&gt;HeroSection.tsx&lt;/code&gt;. Its preview uses the project’s assets and matching cached Next font faces. The public gallery also includes the project’s feature cards and exam-information grid.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


1. Install in the project you want to inspect
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You need Node.js 22 or later, the project’s dependencies installed, and Chromium or Google Chrome.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For Claude Code:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx @ayushniroula/arguseye &lt;span class="nb"&gt;install &lt;/span&gt;claude
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;For Codex:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx @ayushniroula/arguseye &lt;span class="nb"&gt;install &lt;/span&gt;codex
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Restart the client after installation. The installer adds the MCP configuration and bundled agent skill. Other supported installation targets include Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, VS Code Copilot, and Antigravity. The &lt;a href="https://darkworldcoder.github.io/arguseye/guide.html#install" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;installation guide&lt;/a&gt; lists their configuration paths.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To use the visual editor panel, install &lt;a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ayushniroula.arguseye" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Arguseye from the VS Code Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;, open a &lt;code&gt;.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.jsx&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;.vue&lt;/code&gt; file, and run &lt;strong&gt;Arguseye: Preview Component&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


2. Choose a component and its inputs
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ask the agent to discover how the component is used before inventing props:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find the usages of this component. Choose one with resolved literal props, render it at a mobile width, and report any unresolved inputs or provider warnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;list_usages&lt;/code&gt; discovers literal props from JSX and Vue templates, including supported aliases and local barrel re-exports. Runtime expressions remain unresolved. &lt;code&gt;render_component&lt;/code&gt; can then use a discovered usage, while &lt;code&gt;render_usages&lt;/code&gt; provides paginated isolated previews with up to 12 renders per batch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These previews answer how a component renders with discovered inputs. They do not prove a whole page, authenticated session, or backend workflow works.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


3. Capture a baseline before the edit
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A successful render returns a &lt;code&gt;captureId&lt;/code&gt;. Keep that ID and ask the agent to compare against it after editing:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Save this capture ID. After changing the heading, compare against this baseline using the same export, resolved props, and viewport. Show the images, accessibility changes, new errors, and completeness status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The MCP comparison uses &lt;code&gt;render_diff({ baselineId })&lt;/code&gt;. A session retains the latest 64 captures. If the baseline has expired, make a new capture before continuing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For a CLI workflow across separate commands, save the capture in a directory. The following paths and export name are examples; substitute your own component:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx @ayushniroula/arguseye shot src/Card.tsx &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--export&lt;/span&gt; Card &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nt"&gt;--capture-dir&lt;/span&gt; .arguseye/baseline &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nt"&gt;--out&lt;/span&gt; .arguseye/before.png &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--json&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Edit the source, then compare:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx @ayushniroula/arguseye diff &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nt"&gt;--baseline&lt;/span&gt; .arguseye/baseline &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nt"&gt;--out&lt;/span&gt; .arguseye/comparison &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--json&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The output directory contains before, after, and highlighted diff images plus JSON evidence.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


4. Review the comparison
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Comparisons report &lt;code&gt;unchanged&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;changed&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;incomplete&lt;/code&gt;. Review the images alongside dimension changes, accessibility snapshot changes, and new or resolved errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fkad019sfylfsc2dd628w.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fkad019sfylfsc2dd628w.png" alt="Actual WiseAdmit unsaved heading edit with before, after, highlighted differences, and an incomplete-context warning" width="800" height="500"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In this recorded WiseAdmit comparison, the heading changes from “AI ecosystem” to “An AI ecosystem.” The capture records 2,904 changed pixels and an &lt;code&gt;incomplete&lt;/code&gt; status because Next.js server/font behavior in &lt;code&gt;CurrencyProvider&lt;/code&gt; requires the application runtime. The warning remains visible even though the component rendered.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You still have to judge the heading and check the intended layout. The pixel count points to a difference; it cannot establish that the page’s interactions work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


5. Keep the human preview close to the source
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In VS Code, choose an export or discovered usage and inspect the component at mobile, tablet, or desktop widths. Ordinary live edits can preserve interactive state; verification renders start from fresh component state. Vue template and style updates can preserve state, while script changes remount and report the reset.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The panel and agent tools share the rendering engine. That helps the developer inspect the same kind of evidence the agent receives.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Boundaries worth keeping in the workflow
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Browser rendering does not reproduce every framework feature. Next.js server execution, Nuxt application context, and arbitrary backend or authentication state still need the application runtime. Statically reconstructable styles and layout context are supported; missing context remains explicit.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For Next Google fonts, matching assets from an existing &lt;code&gt;.next/static&lt;/code&gt; build can be reused. If those assets are absent, the preview reports unresolved font context. It does not silently turn a fallback font into a complete result.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rendering runs locally, but the component executes real project code and may make its own network requests. Use projects you trust and inspect their behavior as you would when running them normally.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use the comparison to review the component edit. Run the application tests when the change affects a complete page or user journey.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://darkworldcoder.github.io/arguseye/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Get started with Arguseye&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://darkworldcoder.github.io/arguseye/gallery.html" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Real screenshot gallery&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://github.com/DarkWorldCoder/arguseye" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;


useOptimistic en React 19: deshacer sale gratis, el texto del usuario no
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Todas las demos de &lt;code&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/code&gt; que he leído incrementan algo que no puede fallar. Un contador de likes. Una tarea que siempre se guarda. La actualización optimista aparece, el servidor está de acuerdo y listo. Es justo el único caso en que el hook no hacía falta.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;La interfaz optimista se complica en el otro caso: ya le dijiste al usuario que funcionó, y el servidor responde que no. La nota tiene que salir de la lista, el usuario tiene que enterarse de por qué, y lo que escribió tiene que seguir ahí para que pueda intentarlo otra vez. De eso trata este artículo.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Así que aquí va un formulario que puede fallar por motivos reales. Aurora Coffee Co., la tienda de &lt;a href="https://dev.to/jgomezdev/react-server-components-para-veteranos-de-spa-g0l"&gt;React Server Components para veteranos de SPA&lt;/a&gt;, permite a sus clientes dejar notas de preparación en cada café. Un moderador puede cerrar las notas de un café en cualquier momento, la red se puede caer y el servidor puede responder 500. Escribí el formulario de tres maneras, lo hice pasar en un navegador real por cada uno de esos fallos y registré todo lo que habría visto el usuario. La versión obvia del formulario perdió el texto del usuario en un fallo y la página entera en los otros dos.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Todos los ejemplos usan React 19.3 y Next.js 16.4, con un build de producción.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F9yco7qf18smpatnce7dt.jpg" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F9yco7qf18smpatnce7dt.jpg" alt="Una tarjeta de comentario que aparece como enviándose, pierde la conexión con el servidor y deja un hueco vacío en la lista" width="800" height="336"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


El montaje: notas en Postgres y una Server Action que puede decir que no
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Postgres en Docker, para que los fallos vengan de una base de datos real y no de un mock que falla cuando se lo pides:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight yaml"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;postgres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;postgres:18.6-alpine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;POSTGRES_USER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;POSTGRES_PASSWORD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora_local_dev&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;POSTGRES_DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;ports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pi"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;5432:5432"&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pi"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;./seed.sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/01-seed.sql:ro&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pi"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora-pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;healthcheck&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pi"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;CMD-SHELL"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;pg_isready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;-U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;-d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;aurora"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;interval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;5s&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;timeout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;3s&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;retries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="na"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;aurora-pgdata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pi"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;El &lt;code&gt;seed.sql&lt;/code&gt; que va al lado crea dos tablas. &lt;code&gt;notes_locked&lt;/code&gt; es el interruptor del moderador. El &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; de cada nota es un UUID que crea el navegador; el motivo solo aparece cuando una petición falla a medias, y tiene su propia sección más abajo. Las restricciones &lt;code&gt;CHECK&lt;/code&gt; repiten las reglas de longitud que valida la Server Action, así que un error en la acción no puede guardar una nota que el esquema rechazaría:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight sql"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;CREATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;TABLE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;products&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;           &lt;span class="nb"&gt;SERIAL&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="k"&gt;PRIMARY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;         &lt;span class="nb"&gt;TEXT&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;       &lt;span class="nb"&gt;TEXT&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;notes_locked&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;BOOLEAN&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;FALSE&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;CREATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;TABLE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;brew_notes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;         &lt;span class="n"&gt;UUID&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class="k"&gt;PRIMARY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;KEY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;gen_random_uuid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;product_id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;INTEGER&lt;/span&gt;     &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;REFERENCES&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;products&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;     &lt;span class="nb"&gt;TEXT&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;CHECK&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;char_length&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;BETWEEN&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;AND&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;       &lt;span class="nb"&gt;TEXT&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;CHECK&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;char_length&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;BETWEEN&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;AND&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;created_at&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;TIMESTAMPTZ&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NOT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;CREATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;INDEX&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;brew_notes_product_idx&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;ON&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;brew_notes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;product_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;created_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;INSERT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;INTO&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;products&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;VALUES&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Yirgacheffe Reserve'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Ethiopia'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Huila Comunitario'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Colombia'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;INSERT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;INTO&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;brew_notes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;product_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;created_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;VALUES&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Marta'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'V60, 15 g to 250 g at 93 °C. Jasmine all the way through.'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;      &lt;span class="n"&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;interval&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'2 days'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Luis'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Too bright as espresso for me. Great as an AeroPress, 2 minutes.'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;interval&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'1 day'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;La tienda está en inglés, así que los textos de la interfaz también. Los dejé así a propósito: los registros que verás más abajo son la salida real de las pruebas, y traducirlos los convertiría en otra cosa.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;La aplicación es un proyecto estándar de Next.js 16 con el driver de Postgres añadido, más un &lt;code&gt;.env.local&lt;/code&gt; con &lt;code&gt;DATABASE_URL=postgres://aurora:aurora_local_dev@localhost:5432/aurora&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight json"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"name"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"aurora-storefront"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"private"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"engines"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"node"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"&amp;gt;=24"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"scripts"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"dev"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"next dev"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"build"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"next build"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"start"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"next start"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"dependencies"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"next"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"16.4.3"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"pg"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^8.23.1"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"react"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"19.3.1"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"react-dom"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"19.3.1"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"devDependencies"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"@types/node"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^24.19.2"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"@types/pg"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^8.23.1"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"@types/react"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^19.3.0"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"@types/react-dom"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^19.3.0"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"typescript"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"^5.9.3"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Un solo pool de conexiones por proceso. Se guarda en &lt;code&gt;globalThis&lt;/code&gt; para que la recarga en caliente de desarrollo no abra un pool nuevo con cada cambio:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight typescript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// lib/db.ts&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Pool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;pg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;globalForDb&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;globalThis&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;unknown&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;auroraPool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Pool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;globalForDb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;auroraPool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;??&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Pool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;connectionString&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;env&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;DATABASE_URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;max&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;idleTimeoutMillis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;_000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;connectionTimeoutMillis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;_000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;env&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;NODE_ENV&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;!==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;globalForDb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;auroraPool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Las lecturas devuelven objetos planos, porque pasan de un Server Component a un Client Component:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight typescript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// lib/notes.ts&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;createdAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Product&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;getProduct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Product&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;SELECT id, name, origin FROM products WHERE id = $1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;??&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;getBrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;created_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Date&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`SELECT id, author, body, created_at
FROM brew_notes
WHERE product_id = $1
ORDER BY created_at, id`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;createdAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;created_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toISOString&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Lo que envía el formulario, compartido entre el navegador y el servidor. Como los campos se leen en un solo sitio, la nota que el usuario ve mientras se envía queda recortada exactamente igual que la recortará el servidor:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight typescript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// lib/note-input.ts&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;trim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// El id se crea en el navegador antes del primer intento, así que cada reintento&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// de la misma nota lleva el mismo id y el servidor puede reconocer una repetición.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;randomUUID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;crypto.randomUUID()&lt;/code&gt; solo existe en un contexto seguro: HTTPS, o &lt;code&gt;localhost&lt;/code&gt;. Si abres el servidor de desarrollo desde el móvil en &lt;code&gt;http://192.168.x.x:3000&lt;/code&gt;, vale &lt;code&gt;undefined&lt;/code&gt;, la acción lanza una excepción y acabas en la misma pantalla de error a la que este artículo le dedica una sección.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;La página es un Server Component. Lee el producto y sus notas, y le pasa las notas al componente de cliente que contiene el formulario:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/page.tsx&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notFound&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;next/navigation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;getBrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;getProduct&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNotes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./brew-notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;ProductPage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;Number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;isInteger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;notFound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;all&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;([&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;getProduct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;getBrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;notFound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;BrewNotes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/layout.tsx&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ReactNode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;RootLayout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ReactNode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;html&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;lang&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"en"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Y la mutación. Para los fallos que espera, devuelve un resultado en lugar de lanzar una excepción, porque un hilo cerrado es una respuesta, no un error. Sus argumentos llegan del navegador, y los tipos de TypeScript no viajan con ellos, así que los valida en tiempo de ejecución, incluidos &lt;code&gt;productId&lt;/code&gt; y la forma de &lt;code&gt;note&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight typescript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/actions.ts&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;revalidatePath&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;next/cache&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/note-input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Un error devuelto es definitivo: enviar la misma nota otra vez obtendría la misma respuesta.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;PostNoteResult&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;UUID&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sr"&gt;/^&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;0-9a-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;]{8}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;0-9a-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;]{4}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;0-9a-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;]{4}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;0-9a-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;]{4}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;0-9a-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;]{12}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr"&gt;$/i&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;isNoteInput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;unknown&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;!==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;unknown&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;UUID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Promise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;PostNoteResult&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Los dos argumentos llegan del navegador, digan lo que digan sus tipos, así que se validan en tiempo de ejecución.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;Number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;isInteger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;isNoteInput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;This note could not be read. Reload the page and write it again.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;trim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;trim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;length&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;length&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Your name needs to be between 1 and 40 characters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;length&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;length&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;A brew note needs to be between 1 and 500 characters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Una sola sentencia comprueba el cierre e inserta, así que un moderador que cierra&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// el hilo entre medias no puede dejar pasar una nota. ON CONFLICT hace inofensivo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// un reintento: si un intento anterior ya guardó este id, no se inserta dos veces.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rowCount&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`INSERT INTO brew_notes (id, product_id, author, body)
SELECT $1, id, $3, $4 FROM products WHERE id = $2 AND NOT notes_locked
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;rowCount&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;===&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// No se insertó nada. Averiguar por qué antes de decirle nada al usuario.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;saved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;locked&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`SELECT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM brew_notes WHERE id = $1 AND product_id = $2) AS saved,
(SELECT notes_locked FROM products WHERE id = $2) AS locked`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;saved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;locked&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;rows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;saved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;locked&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Notes on this coffee were closed while you were writing. Your note was not posted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;This coffee is no longer available. Your note was not posted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="nf"&gt;revalidatePath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`/products/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;El &lt;code&gt;INSERT … SELECT … WHERE NOT notes_locked&lt;/code&gt; es lo que hace que el cierre funcione de verdad. Si consultas el indicador con una sentencia e insertas con otra, queda un hueco entre las dos, y si el moderador cierra el hilo justo en ese hueco, la nota del cliente entra igual. Con una sola sentencia no hay hueco. La parte del &lt;code&gt;ON CONFLICT&lt;/code&gt;, y la consulta posterior que averigua &lt;em&gt;por qué&lt;/em&gt; no se insertó nada, sirven para más adelante.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Cómo lo probé
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Cada versión corrió como build de producción (&lt;code&gt;next build &amp;amp;&amp;amp; next start&lt;/code&gt;) en Chromium sin interfaz, controlado con Playwright. El script retenía cada petición de Server Action durante 1,5 segundos, lo suficiente para ver cada estado, y registraba cada cambio en la página: la lista de notas, el botón, el área de texto y cualquier mensaje de error. Una nota marcada &lt;code&gt;(sending)&lt;/code&gt; es una que el servidor todavía no ha confirmado. Para provocar los fallos, el script activaba &lt;code&gt;notes_locked&lt;/code&gt; con una petición en curso, cortaba la conexión o respondía 500 en lugar del servidor.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Los registros de abajo son la salida de ese script, copiada tal cual. Cada línea muestra solo los campos que cambiaron.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Versión 1: la que escribes primero
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Antes de React 19, una interfaz optimista era una copia de los datos del servidor en &lt;code&gt;useState&lt;/code&gt;, una actualización antes de la petición y una reversión en el &lt;code&gt;catch&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/brew-notes.tsx (versión 1)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormEvent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/note-input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;DisplayedNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;BrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;serverNotes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;DisplayedNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;serverNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;isPosting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setIsPosting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setAuthor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setBody&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;handleSubmit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormEvent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;HTMLFormElement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;preventDefault&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;FormData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;currentTarget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;previous&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;([...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;createdAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;().&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toISOString&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setIsPosting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setBody&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;previous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;previous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Could not reach the server. Your note was not posted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;finally&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setIsPosting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Brew notes&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;data-sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;undefined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;em&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; (sending…)&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;em&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"alert"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onSubmit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;handleSubmit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"author"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setAuthor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;textarea&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"body"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setBody&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"submit"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;disabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;isPosting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;isPosting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Posting…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Post note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Contempla todos los fallos. Y aun así se equivoca en el único caso que sale bien:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### success
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
95 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
174 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
181 ms  POST #1 sent
1772 ms  POST #1 answered 200
1784 ms  button: Post note | textarea: ""
final state: list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
notes saved in Postgres: 1
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;El servidor guardó la nota y Postgres la tiene, pero la nota dice &lt;code&gt;(sending)&lt;/code&gt; para siempre. &lt;code&gt;useState(serverNotes)&lt;/code&gt; lee su argumento una sola vez, en el primer render. Cuando &lt;code&gt;revalidatePath&lt;/code&gt; manda las notas nuevas desde el servidor, llega la prop nueva y nadie la lee. En una revisión de código, nada de esto parece roto.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;El arreglo habitual es un efecto que copia la prop en el estado cada vez que cambia:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/brew-notes.tsx (versión 1, fragmento: el arreglo que todos añaden)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;useEffect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;serverNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;serverNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Con él, una nota funciona. Dos notas enviándose a la vez, no. Para tener dos, el script envió una segunda nota mientras la primera seguía enviándose, con &lt;code&gt;form.requestSubmit()&lt;/code&gt;. Así se suele programar un atajo Ctrl+Enter en una caja de comentarios, y a &lt;code&gt;requestSubmit()&lt;/code&gt; no le importa que el botón esté deshabilitado. La primera nota falla:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### two in flight, first fails
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
117 ms  textarea: "Note A"
188 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
189 ms  POST #1 sent
632 ms  textarea: "Note B"
640 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending), Ben (sending)
2704 ms  POST #1 failed: connection dropped
2714 ms  POST #2 sent
2720 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | alert: "Could not reach the server. Your note was not posted."
3796 ms  POST #2 answered 200
3803 ms  textarea: ""
3808 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ben
final state: list: Marta, Luis, Ben | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: "Could not reach the server. Your note was not posted."
notes saved in Postgres: 1
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Cuando falló la primera nota, se ejecutó &lt;code&gt;setNotes(previous)&lt;/code&gt;, y &lt;code&gt;previous&lt;/code&gt; era la lista de antes de &lt;em&gt;las dos&lt;/em&gt; notas. La nota de Ben desapareció mientras todavía se estaba enviando. Además, el botón volvió a habilitarse con esa nota aún en camino: &lt;code&gt;isPosting&lt;/code&gt; es un único booleano para dos peticiones, y el &lt;code&gt;finally&lt;/code&gt; de la primera lo apagó. La nota de Ben reaparece un segundo después, cuando llega la lista del servidor. Cada uno de esos errores tiene arreglo. Ninguno de los arreglos tiene que ver con lo que este componente debe hacer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fo6yrmj2so5gfdln2efox.jpg" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fo6yrmj2so5gfdln2efox.jpg" alt="Dos notas enviadas a la vez, donde volver a una copia vieja de la lista borra también la segunda nota, que sí se estaba guardando" width="800" height="336"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


useFormStatus: el estado pendiente, sacado del propio formulario
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;React 19 permite pasarle una función a la prop &lt;code&gt;action&lt;/code&gt; de un &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;form&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;. El formulario la llama con su &lt;code&gt;FormData&lt;/code&gt;, dentro de una transición, y a partir de ahí sabe si esa llamada sigue en curso. &lt;code&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/code&gt; lee esa información:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/submit-button.tsx&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react-dom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;SubmitButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"submit"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;disabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Posting…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Post note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Un componente entero para un botón, y el motivo es el error más común con este hook. &lt;code&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/code&gt; informa del estado del &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;form&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; que &lt;strong&gt;renderiza al componente que lo llama&lt;/strong&gt;, así que hay que llamarlo &lt;em&gt;dentro&lt;/em&gt; del formulario. Si lo llamas en el componente que renderiza el &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;form&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, todavía no hay ningún formulario por encima. No lanza ningún error ni muestra ninguna advertencia. Devuelve &lt;code&gt;pending: false&lt;/code&gt;, siempre.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Este es ese error, con el hook en el componente que contiene el formulario, y el usuario haciendo doble clic:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/brew-notes.tsx (el hook mal ubicado)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react-dom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/note-input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;BrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// No hay ningún &amp;lt;form&amp;gt; por encima de este componente, así que siempre es false.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useFormStatus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Brew notes&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"author"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;textarea&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"body"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"submit"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;disabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Posting…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Post note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### useFormStatus in the form owner, double click
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
225 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
317 ms  POST #1 sent
1939 ms  POST #1 answered 200
1956 ms  POST #2 sent
3507 ms  POST #2 answered 200
3521 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana, Ana | textarea: ""
final state: list: Marta, Luis, Ana, Ana | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
notes saved in Postgres: 2
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;El botón nunca cambió, así que el segundo clic también se envió, y la misma nota quedó dos veces en la base de datos. Cada clic creó su propia nota con su propio id, de modo que el servidor no tenía forma de distinguirlas. El mismo doble clic contra la versión final, donde &lt;code&gt;SubmitButton&lt;/code&gt; es hijo del formulario:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### double click
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
85 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
151 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled) | textarea: ""
152 ms  POST #1 sent
1773 ms  POST #1 answered 200
1792 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana | button: Post note
final state: list: Marta, Luis, Ana | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
notes saved in Postgres: 1
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Una petición, una fila. Ese componente extra es lo que cuesta que el botón se entere de algo.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


useOptimistic: estado que solo existe mientras corre una acción
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/code&gt; recibe el valor real y un reducer, y devuelve el valor que hay que mostrar más una función para añadir un cambio optimista:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;displayedNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;addOptimisticNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Se lee así: &lt;em&gt;muestra &lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt;, más cada borrador que haya añadido una acción que todavía está en curso.&lt;/em&gt; Ese es el modelo completo, y los dos errores de la versión 1 no caben en él:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;No hay copia de los datos del servidor.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt; es la prop. Cuando &lt;code&gt;revalidatePath&lt;/code&gt; manda una lista nueva, el hook muestra la lista nueva, con los borradores pendientes encima. Sin efecto y sin &lt;code&gt;useState&lt;/code&gt; desactualizado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;No hay reversión.&lt;/strong&gt; Cuando las acciones terminan, sus borradores se descartan, y lo que queda es lo que valga &lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt; en ese momento. Si el servidor guardó la nota, &lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt; ya la incluye. Si no la guardó, la nota simplemente no está. Deshacer no es código que escribas: es lo que pasa cuando no escribes nada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;"Cuando las acciones terminan", en plural, a propósito. Más adelante importa.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;addOptimisticNote&lt;/code&gt; tiene que llamarse dentro de una acción o de una transición. Una función pasada a &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;form action&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; cumple esa condición, así que esto funciona tal cual:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/brew-notes.tsx (versión 2)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/note-input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;SubmitButton&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./submit-button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;DisplayedNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;BrewNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nl"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;displayedNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;addOptimisticNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;DisplayedNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[],&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;DisplayedNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;formData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nf"&gt;addOptimisticNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;createdAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;().&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;toISOString&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;productId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setError&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Brew notes&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;displayedNotes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;data-sending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;undefined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sending&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;em&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; (sending…)&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;em&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;li&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"alert"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"author"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;textarea&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"body"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;maxLength&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;SubmitButton&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Los argumentos de tipo explícitos en &lt;code&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/code&gt; hacen falta porque el hook deduce su tipo de &lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt;, que es &lt;code&gt;BrewNote[]&lt;/code&gt;, y los borradores llevan un indicador &lt;code&gt;sending&lt;/code&gt; que &lt;code&gt;BrewNote&lt;/code&gt; no tiene. Sin ellos, &lt;code&gt;note.sending&lt;/code&gt; no compila.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;El caso en que todo sale bien, para que conste:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### success
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
105 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
168 ms  POST #1 sent
168 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
1782 ms  POST #1 answered 200
1800 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana | button: Post note | textarea: ""
final state: list: Marta, Luis, Ana | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
notes saved in Postgres: 1
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;La nota optimista se convirtió en la real en el mismo render que trajo la lista del servidor. No hubo parpadeo, porque &lt;code&gt;revalidatePath&lt;/code&gt; devuelve las notas nuevas en la respuesta de la propia acción (el navegador no hizo ninguna otra petición), y React cambia el borrador por la nota real en un solo paso. El borrador y la nota guardada comparten además el &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt;, el UUID de &lt;code&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/code&gt;, así que React conserva el mismo &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; en lugar de reemplazarlo.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ahora, los fallos.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Qué pasa cuando falla, de principio a fin
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


La nota se retira bien. Lo que escribió el usuario, no
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;El moderador cierra las notas mientras la petición de Ana está en curso:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### locked mid-write
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
86 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
150 ms  POST #1 sent
150 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
1696 ms  POST #1 answered 200
1707 ms  alert: "Notes on this coffee were closed while you were writing. Your note was not posted."
1713 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: ""
final state: list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: "Notes on this coffee were closed while you were writing. Your note was not posted."
notes saved in Postgres: 0
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;La nota salió de la lista, apareció el error y el botón volvió. Esa es la reversión, y no costó ni una línea de código. Ahora mira el área de texto en la última línea: vacía.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;La nota de Ana fue rechazada, y lo que escribió desapareció. Cuando le pasas una función a &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;form action&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, React pide restablecer el formulario &lt;em&gt;antes incluso de llamar a tu función&lt;/em&gt;, y lo aplica, con el &lt;code&gt;form.reset()&lt;/code&gt; del propio navegador, cuando se confirma la transición de la acción. Lo que devuelva tu acción no influye: &lt;code&gt;{ ok: false }&lt;/code&gt; y &lt;code&gt;{ ok: true }&lt;/code&gt; restablecen el formulario igual. Así que el usuario lee que su nota no se publicó y, en ese mismo instante, pierde la nota.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Esta es la trampa de todo el artículo. En un botón de like no hay nada que perder. En cualquier cosa que alguien haya escrito, el restablecimiento es lo peor del fallo.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Los campos controlados se salvan, y conviene saber por qué. &lt;code&gt;form.reset()&lt;/code&gt; devuelve cada campo a su valor &lt;em&gt;por defecto&lt;/em&gt;, y en un campo controlado React mantiene el valor por defecto igual al actual. El restablecimiento se ejecuta y vuelve a poner lo que ya había. (Si pasas a la vez &lt;code&gt;value&lt;/code&gt; y &lt;code&gt;defaultValue&lt;/code&gt;, eso deja de cumplirse.)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Un error lanzado se lleva la página entera
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ahora lo que se cae es la red:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### network failure
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
133 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
197 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
200 ms  POST #1 sent
1706 ms  POST #1 failed: connection dropped
1833 ms  uncaught error: Failed to fetch
1834 ms  page: "This page couldn’t load" (the form is gone)
final state: page: "This page couldn’t load" (the form is gone)
notes saved in Postgres: 0
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Eso no es el formulario mostrando un error. Es la página completa reemplazada por la pantalla de error de Next.js. Cuando la llamada a la Server Action falla, &lt;code&gt;await postBrewNote(...)&lt;/code&gt; lanza una excepción dentro de la acción, nadie la captura, y un error lanzado por la acción de un formulario va al error boundary más cercano, igual que un error durante el render. Sin ningún &lt;code&gt;error.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, el más cercano es el de la raíz. Un 500 hace lo mismo, con otro mensaje:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;### server 500
0 ms  list: Marta, Luis | button: Post note | textarea: "" | alert: none
79 ms  textarea: "Cold brew, 18 hours. Like jasmine tea."
144 ms  POST #1 sent
144 ms  list: Marta, Luis, Ana (sending) | button: Posting… (disabled)
1646 ms  POST #1 answered 500
1707 ms  uncaught error: An unexpected response was received from the server.
1707 ms  page: "This page couldn’t load" (the form is gone)
final state: page: "This page couldn’t load" (the form is gone)
notes saved in Postgres: 0
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Un &lt;code&gt;error.tsx&lt;/code&gt; cambiaría la página del producto por algo más presentable, que sigue sin ser lo que el usuario necesita. Lo que falló fue su nota, no la página. Así que la acción captura el error.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


"Tu nota no se publicó" puede ser mentira
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;El &lt;code&gt;catch&lt;/code&gt; de la versión 1 dice &lt;em&gt;no se pudo contactar con el servidor, tu nota no se publicó&lt;/em&gt;. El navegador no puede saber la segunda parte. La conexión puede caerse &lt;em&gt;después&lt;/em&gt; de que Postgres confirmara la nota y antes de que llegara la respuesta. Entonces la nota está publicada, la pantalla dice que no, y el usuario hace lo razonable: lo intenta otra vez y la publica dos veces.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Para eso están el UUID creado en el navegador y el &lt;code&gt;ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING&lt;/code&gt;. El id queda fijado antes del primer intento, cada reintento manda el mismo, y una segunda inserción con ese id no hace nada. Después, la acción encuentra la nota ya guardada y responde &lt;code&gt;ok&lt;/code&gt;. Reintentar es seguro, así que el mensaje puede decirlo con honestidad en lugar de adivinar.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ese mismo razonamiento decide qué fallos llevan un botón &lt;em&gt;Try again&lt;/em&gt;. Una excepción significa &lt;em&gt;no lo sabemos&lt;/em&gt;, y reintentar es la forma de averiguarlo. Un error devuelto es la respuesta definitiva del servidor: el hilo está cerrado, y mandar la misma nota otra vez obtiene la misma respuesta. Por eso solo el primer tipo se puede reintentar.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


El usuario ya está escribiendo la siguiente nota
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Al probar los arreglos apareció un caso más. Ana publica una nota y, mientras se envía, empieza a escribir la siguiente. Cualquier código que vacíe el área de texto &lt;em&gt;cuando termina la petición&lt;/em&gt; (el restablecimiento de React, o un &lt;code&gt;setBody('')&lt;/code&gt; tras el éxito) la vacía cuando ya contiene la segunda nota.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Por eso la versión final vacía el área de texto en el momento del envío, en un manejador &lt;code&gt;onSubmit&lt;/code&gt;, que se ejecuta antes de la acción y fuera de su transición. React llama primero a tu &lt;code&gt;onSubmit&lt;/code&gt;, y el &lt;code&gt;FormData&lt;/code&gt; se lee antes de que esa actualización se renderice, así que la nota sale con su texto. Vaciar el campo tan pronto tampoco pierde nada. El texto ya está en la lista como borrador, y si la petición falla, se queda en la lista con su propio error y el texto intacto.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Versión 3
&lt;/h3&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/products/[id]/brew-notes.tsx (versión 3)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;startTransition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;FormEvent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;BrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;noteFromForm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;NoteInput&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/note-input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;postBrewNote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;SubmitButton&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;./submit-button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

